(422, 130, '', 'Amul Taaza Toned Milk (Polypack) is pasteurized with a great nutritional value. It can be consumed directly or can be used for preparing tea, coffee, sweets, khoya, curd, buttermilk, ghee etc.  Product Highlights Health Benefits: Rich in calcium Type: Toned Milk Shelf Life: 2 days Storage Tips: Store in a freezer to keep it at an optimum temperature.'),
(423, 123, '', 'Pasteurized in state-of-the-art processing plants, Amul Gold Milk (Tetra Pak) is very rich and creamy in texture. It is ideal for preparing tea, coffee, sweets, khoya, curd, buttermilk, ghee etc.  Product Highlights Health Benefits: Rich in calcium Type: Full Cream Milk Shelf Life: 6 months Storage Tips: Store in a freezer to keep it at an optimum temperature. Ingredients: Standardized Milk, Fat 4.5% minimum, SNF 8.5% minimum'),
(424, 122, '', ''),
(425, 45, '', 'Health Benefits: Rich in potassium, fibre, vitamin C and vitamin B6, Banana aids digestion, increases insulin sensitivity and checks blood pressure., Vitamin A & K Rich Serve Size: Serves 4-5 Shelf Life: 3 days Storage Tips: To maintain freshness, wrap in plastic bag and store in the vegetable/fruit crisper of the refrigerator.'),
