(440, 74, '', 'Guava is a tropical fruit which is related to a pear in shape. Its color is a shade of green which alters over to yellow as the fruit ripens. The entire of the guava fruit along with the seeds and the rind is edible. It is wealthy in Vitamin C. As compared to citrus fruits such as the vitamin c content in guava, the orange and its rind is almost five times greater.  Product Highlights Health Benefits: Lowers Hypertension Serve Size: Serves 2-3 Shelf Life: 2 days Storage Tips: To maintain freshness, wrap in plastic bag and store in the vegetable crisper of the refrigerator.'),
